  "details": "With the Groups system being in development,\nIt would be a better idea to add discord-like features\n\nWith little information publicly known, its safe to build on expected features  \n\nExamples include:\n- Using a boost system for tiered unlocks \n- 2 Boosts unlock custom group emojis and group avatar slots \n- Group avatars slots, boosts unlock more features for everyone \n- Group emojis (can use templates for particle animations, think snowball and confetti), boosts unlock more slots\n- & more! \nTL:DR The more boosts for a group, the more slots",
